{"id":"n31457-1-19","stage":1,"title":"번호 · 号码","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31457-1-19-1","ko":"신청서에 학년하고 반만 적으면 돼?","zh":"申请表上只要写上年级和班级就行吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신청서에","meaning":"申请书","explanation":"신청서：申请书；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"신청서","audio":"/audio/d756749ae151055bb3f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14074","senseId":"1","lemma":"신청서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신청서에","audio":"/audio/0e647a28c8e26b2fc3e4.mp3"}},{"text":"학년하고","meaning":"年级","explanation":"학년：年级；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"학년","audio":"/audio/8f9b4a647efa5527228c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31671","senseId":"2","lemma":"학년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학년하고","audio":"/audio/df7f9836d6571b7469f8.mp3"}},{"text":"반만","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반만","audio":"/audio/19a3bc9bf785faf486cc.mp3"}},{"text":"적으면","meaning":"写","explanation":"적다：写；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71234","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적으면","audio":"/audio/89b8ed8a18463702b5c9.mp3"}},{"text":"돼?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d756749ae151055b","term":"신청서","zh":"申请书","audio":"/audio/d756749ae151055bb3f2.mp3","entryId":"14074","definition":"向团体或机关等要求某事项时填写的文件。","pronunciation":["신청서"]},