Reading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"번인지","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번인지","audio":"/audio/335034928ac68f2de6fb.mp3"}},{"text":"번호까지","meaning":"号码","explanation":"번호：号码；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"번호","audio":"/audio/00e65ebb3d8a52e54e6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31457","senseId":"1","lemma":"번호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번호까지","audio":"/audio/bc193356f2ceadb86fb0.mp3"}},{"text":"적어야","meaning":"写","explanation":"적다：写；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71234","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적어야","audio":"/audio/25f4ffb8d67503f3d7fc.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁，旁边","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"指左右两侧中的一侧。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce